plasma-panel-colorizer (2:8.1.0-1nano) unstable; urgency=low

  * New upstream release

  [Nanolx]
  * change arch from all to any, as the qml-plugin is now bundled
  * update build-deps for c++ plugin
  * update debian/rules for c++ plugin

  [Upstream]
  * Features
    * option to change distance between panel and screen edge
    * add option to keep original text/icon colors per widget
  * Bug Fixes
    * don't inherit the background colorSet to the foreground color
    * less chance of hang when spacing is 0 on Plasma 6.8.2 and older
    * preset management regressions after #585
    * preset not saving when it gets too big
    * remove problematic workaround for panel length bug 489086
  * Translations
    * add Vietnamese (vi) translation
    * update Russian translation
    * update Simplified Chinese (zh)
    * update Spanish translation

 -- Christopher Roy Bratusek <nano@jpberlin.de>  Wed, 11 Nov 2026 17:19:08 +0100

